      "body": "## Overview\n\nAdd Kimi-K2.6 Guide insertion anchors for the Ascend overlay and make the shared client example follow the selected model.\n\nDepends on the renderer support in https://github.com/vllm-project/recipes/pull/1170. Companion overlay: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/20795.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Place Huawei prerequisites within Prerequisites, deployment instructions before Client Usage, and Ascend links in References.\n- Keep one shared Client Usage example, including when no Ascend overlay is loaded.\n- Replace the fixed client model ID with `{{client_model}}`, resolved by the renderer from the selected checkpoint or serving alias.\n\nOnly `recipes/models/moonshotai/Kimi-K2.6.yaml` is changed. Existing GPU launch parameters and inference code are unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Full recipe assembly and JSON API generation passed with the companion renderer and Ascend overlay.\n- Focused checks confirmed section ordering, a single Client Usage section, reference placement, and preservation of the client example without an overlay.\n- Client-model regression tests and `git diff --check` passed.\n- Full repository pre-commit checks were not completed locally.\n- Model evaluation is not applicable to this presentation-only change.\n\n## Details\n\nWithout owner insertion anchors, overlay sections append to the end of the Guide. Keeping the client example in the owner recipe also avoids maintaining a duplicate Ascend example.\n\nNo matching open recipe-layout PR was found during the duplicate-work check. Merge only after recipes #1170 is deployed. Human review remains required.\n\nAI assistance was used.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull Request Checklist</summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill.\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Reuses the existing overlay marker mechanism.\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:** Focused checks passed; remaining limitations are documented.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Minimal single-file change with no unrelated edits.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Scope, dependencies, validation, and limitations are documented.\n\n</details>\n",
